---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Clinic Management Software in India | Qare.in">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-5xl my-20">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-1 font-bricolage">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-md font-bold text-center">Your practice. Your data. Period.</p>
    <div class="max-w-5xl flex-1 [&>h2]:text-xl [&>h2]:font-bold [&>p]:mb-6 mx-auto p-10">
      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect and process the following categories of data:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-6">
        <li>Account & contact data (e.g., name, email) when you sign up or contact support</li>
        <li>Clinic & patient data you choose to store in Qare (e.g., appointments, records, prescriptions)</li>
        <li>Usage & diagnostic data (e.g., API requests, error logs) to operate and secure the Service</li>
        <li>Payment data processed by our payment provider (Razorpay); we receive limited details like payment status and identifiers</li>
        <li>Communications metadata where messaging integrations are used (e.g., WhatsApp Cloud API), not message content unless explicitly stored</li>
      </ul>      

      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">2. How We Use Information</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-6">
        <li>Provide and maintain the Service you requested</li>
        <li>Set up billing and process payments via Razorpay</li>
        <li>Send transactional messages (e.g., verification, service notifications)</li>
        <li>Monitor performance, troubleshoot issues, and enhance security</li>
        <li>Comply with legal and regulatory requirements</li>
      </ul>      

      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">3. Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards to protect information, including HTTPS for data in transit and role‑based access controls. 
        No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure. Access to production data is limited to authorized personnel for support and operations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">4. Healthcare Data</h2>
      <p>
        Patient data you input into Qare is under your control. We process it to provide the Service and do not use it for advertising.
         Your responsibilities as a healthcare provider (including obtaining consents and complying with medical privacy laws) continue to apply.      
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">5. Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell personal data. We share information with:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-6">
        <li>Service providers (e.g., AWS for hosting, Razorpay for payments, WhatsApp Cloud API for messaging, email delivery)</li>
        <li>Authorities when required by law or to protect rights and safety</li>
        <li>Successors in interest in connection with a corporate transaction</li>
      </ul>  
      
      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">6. Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain data for as long as needed to provide the Service and for legitimate business or legal purposes (e.g., records, fraud prevention). 
        You may request deletion; some data may be retained as required by law or for backups.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">7. Your Choices</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-6">
        <li>Access, correct, or delete certain personal data by contacting us</li>
        <li>Export or request a copy of your data where feasible</li>
        <li>Object to or restrict processing in specific circumstances</li>
      </ul> 
      
      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">8. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use essential cookies to keep you signed in and operate the Service. 
        You can control cookies through your browser settings; blocking essential cookies may impact 
        functionality.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">9. International Transfers</h2>
      <p>
        Because we use cloud infrastructure and service providers, your data may be processed in jurisdictions other than your own, 
        subject to appropriate safeguards and contracts.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">10. Children</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become aware of such collection, we will take steps to delete the information.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">11. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy and will reflect the effective date above. If we make material changes, we will provide additional notice when reasonable.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-bricolage mt-1">12. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at 
        <a class="text-brand" href="support@qare.in">support[@]qare.in</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>